WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.680
It deleted its dependencies instead of wrapping them.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.285
A Gaussian Splatting pipeline in one binary: no Python, no PyTorch.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.339
Rewritten, not wrapped.

00:00:12.339 --> 00:00:17.097
COLMAP became 44,310 lines of Vulkan SfM.

00:00:17.097 --> 00:00:21.175
PyTorch became a 10,886-line Slang runtime.

00:00:21.175 --> 00:00:25.253
Ffmpeg became its own video decoders.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:35.029
AUC@10 every time in fp64, three identical runs of one capture: 96.1.

00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:40.121
Fp32 runs: 96.5 / 92.3 / 91.5.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.919
One stack, not six.

00:00:42.919 --> 00:00:46.190
Nothing yet says its reconstructions match COLMAP's.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:53.358
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
